  "details": "1. Log into VRChat with an account (A)\n\n2. Use the \"Switch account\" button to switch to an alternate account (B)\n\n3. Explore the main menu\n\nI noticed the following:\n\n- In the groups tab, account B could see all the groups that account A belonged to, despite account B not belonging to them.\n\n- The UI kept the custom color selected by account A, despite account B not having a VRC+ subscription, thus having no access to custom UI colors.\n\nExiting VRChat entirely and logging back on with account B fixed the issue.\n\nSince this seemed to affect VRC+ features, I decided to not test it again, in case it caused problems with the subscription.",
